
<!DOCTYPE html>
<html lang="it">
<head>
  <meta charset="UTF-8">
  <meta name="viewport" content="width=device-width, initial-scale=1.0">
  <title>WBC HOSTING</title>
  <style>
    * { box-sizing: border-box; }
    body {
      margin: 0;
      background: #090909;
      color: #f5f5f5;
      font-family: Arial, sans-serif;
    }
    header {
      padding: 24px;
      border-bottom: 1px solid #b88a32;
      background: #111;
    }
    header h1 { color: #e6b84c; margin: 0; }
    header p { color: #aaa; margin-bottom: 0; }
    main { padding: 22px; max-width: 1000px; margin: auto; }
    .grid {
      display: grid;
      grid-template-columns: repeat(auto-fit, minmax(220px, 1fr));
      gap: 16px;
    }
    .card {
      background: #151515;
      border: 1px solid #34302a;
      border-radius: 14px;
      padding: 20px;
    }
    .card h2 { color: #e6b84c; font-size: 18px; }
    .status { color: #f0bd4b; }
    button {
      background: #d6a63e;
      color: #111;
      border: 0;
      border-radius: 8px;
      padding: 12px 16px;
      font-weight: bold;
      cursor: pointer;
    }
    button:hover { background: #f4ce72; }
    footer { text-align: center; color: #777; padding: 30px; }
  </style>
</head>
<body>
  <header>
    <h1>⟦ WBC HOSTING ⟧</h1>
    <p>Il tuo spazio di gestione Discord</p>
  </header>

  <main>
    <h2>Dashboard</h2>
    <div class="grid">
      <section class="card">
        <h2>🖥️ Server</h2>
        <p class="status">● Pannello inizializzato</p>
        <p>Il sistema di hosting deve ancora essere collegato.</p>
      </section>

      <section class="card">
        <h2>🤖 Gestione bot</h2>
        <p>Avvio, arresto e riavvio dei bot Discord.</p>
        <p>Backend: non collegato</p>
      </section>

      <section class="card">
        <h2>📊 Risorse</h2>
        <p>CPU: in attesa del server</p>
        <p>RAM: in attesa del server</p>
      </section>

      <section class="card">
        <h2>📋 Console</h2>
        <p>Qui mostreremo i log dei bot quando il backend sarà configurato.</p>
        <button onclick="alert('La console sarà attivata nel prossimo passaggio.')">
          Apri console
        </button>
      </section>
    </div>
  </main>

  <footer>WBC HOSTING · Progetto in sviluppo</footer>
</body>
</html>
